# Formspree form ID: the part after https://formspree.io/f/
# Powers the contact form and the PrimeTIPS newsletter signup.
# Without it both render a labelled email fallback instead of failing silently.
#
# The live value is set in .env, which is gitignored. Copy this file to .env and
# fill it in on any new machine or CI runner, or the contact form ships as the
# "not yet connected" notice.
PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_ID=
